<p>Umme kulsoom qwaahar e zainab<br>
Zindagi bhar sahi tu ranj o ta'ab<br>
Guzre rone me tere roz o shab<br>
Margayi gham utha ke haye ghazab</p>

<p>Ab ali o batool rote hai<br>
Peet kar sar rasool rote hai<br>
____________________________</p>

<p>Bhai ko roz o shab jo roti thi<br>
Muh ko ashkou se apne dhoti thi<br>
Gham se fursat jise na hoti thi<br>
Jaan ro ro ke apni khoti thi</p>

<p>Wo jaha'n se guzar gayi hai hai<br>
Umme kulsoom margayi hai hai</p>

<p>Yaad aate hai tere gham bibi<br>
Wo aseeri wo qaid ki saqti<br>
Tujh pe yu rash ghamo alam ki thi<br>
Uf wo rudaad be ridaayi ki</p>

<p>Tujhko jab se ghame hussain mila<br>
Ek pal bhi tujhe na chain mila<br>
____________________________</p>

<p>Qaid se chut ke jab watan aayi<br>
Sath bhai ka apne gham laayi<br>
Zabt karne na paayi dukh paayi<br>
Dekha jis dam madina chillayi</p>

<p>Gham pe gham hum utha ke aaye hai<br>
Saare ghar ko luta ke aaye hai<br>
____________________________</p>

<p>Aye madine hame qubool na kar<br>
Kat gaya tegh se hussain ka sar<br>
Chin gayi thi sarou se bhi chadar<br>
Wapas aate hai phir ke hum dar dar</p>

<p>Marte dam tak ye gham uthaana hai<br>
Aisa aana bhi koi aana hai<br>
____________________________</p>

<p>Ham museebat utha ke aaye hai<br>
Qaid qaane me jaake aaye hai<br>
Bhai bete gawaa ke aaye hai<br>
Qabr sheh ki banake aaye hai</p>

<p>Sath bete hai aur na waali hai<br>
Godiya bibiyo ki qaali hai<br>
____________________________</p>

<p>Bain tu ne kiye jo zaar o qataar<br>
Gham se dil hogaye sabhi ke figaar<br>
Daagh the tere ek dil pe hazaar<br>
Kitni pur dard thi wo teri pukaar</p>

<p>Qoo'n rulata hai marsiya tera<br>
Gham se dil choor choor tha tera<br>
____________________________</p>

<p>Haye kaisi ulat gayi taqdeer<br>
Gayi darbaar me tu ho ke aseer<br>
Aaqri saans tak rahi dilgeer<br>
Umme kulsoom qaahare shabbir</p>

<p>Karbala jab bhi yaad aati hai<br>
Yaad hum ko teri rulaati hai<br>
____________________________</p>

<p>Sare baazaar sar khule jaana<br>
Durre zalim ke pusht par khana<br>
Yaad abbas ko wo farmana<br>
Tera darbaare sham me jaana</p>

<p>Qatm har ek jafa huwi tujh par<br>
Zulm ki inteha huwi tujh par<br>
____________________________</p>